        "subject": "Official Inquiry Response: Computer Science Program Details & Syllabus",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>University Official Response</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f3f4f6; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\">\n  <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 40px 0;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table width=\"620\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\">\n          \n          <!-- Header Banner with Gradient -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #3b82f6 50%, #06b6d4 100%); padding: 35px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n              <h1 style=\"color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">\n                🎓 University Student Services\n              </h1>\n              <p style=\"color: #e0e7ff; margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;\">\n                Official Admissions & Academic Advisory Center\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Main Content Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 40px 35px; color: #374151; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n              \n              <!-- Greeting -->\n              <p style=\"margin-top: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b;\">\n                Dear Student,\n              </p>\n              \n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 25px; color: #4b5563;\">\n                Thank you for reaching out to the University Helpdesk. Regarding your inquiry, please find the official details and instructions below:\n              </p>\n\n              <!-- Dynamic AI Response Box -->\n              <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin: 25px 0;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 5px solid #2563eb; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-right: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 22px; color: #1e293b; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8;\">\n                    {{ JSON.parse($('Counselor AI Agent').first().json.output).response }}\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 25px; color: #4b5563;\">\n                If you require further assistance or need additional details about admissions, fees, or course schedules, please do not hesitate to contact us.\n              </p>\n\n              <!-- Action Callout Badge -->\n              <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin: 30px 0 10px 0;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\">\n                    <div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 30px; padding: 10px 24px;\">\n                      <span style=\"color: #1d4ed8; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\">\n                        💡 Official Prospectus & Information Desk\n                      </span>\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Sign-off & Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 30px 35px; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\">\n              <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #64748b;\">Warm regards,</p>\n              <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">Office of Student Admissions & Counseling</p>\n              <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8;\">\n                University Support Network | Contact: support@university.edu\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>",
